        "en": "Clean and welcoming modern facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently comment on the clinic's spotless environment, noting modern examination rooms, organized waiting areas, and a pleasant setting that reduces anxiety. The comfortable atmosphere reassures pet parents that their companions are in a sanitary and professional environment."
      }
    }
